<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan produces 8.77 mln bales cotton in '96/97.</title>
<headline>Pakistan produces 8.77 mln bales cotton in '96/97.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's cotton output for 1996/97 (July-June) was 8.77 million bales, down from 9.95 million the previous year, the state-run Cotton Export Corporation of Pakistan said in its final report on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Delivery and ginning figures in million bales (year-ago):</p>
<p>		    Punjab	   Sindh	    Total</p>
<p> Delivery	 6.690 (8.179)  2.084 (1.771)  8.774 (9.951)</p>
<p> Pressed	  6.690 (8.179)  2.084 (1.771)  8.774 (9.951)</p>
<p> Mill sales     6.490 (7.098)  2.042 (1.286)  8.533 (8.385)</p>
<p> Export sales   0.067 (1.023)  0.022 (0.485)  0.089 (1.509)</p>
<p> CEC		nil   (nil)    nil   (nil)    nil   (nil)</p>
<p> Unsold	   0.131 (0.057)  0.020 (nil)    0.151 (0.057)</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
